  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Define > Business need",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN provides guidance for all contracting authorities in relation to their obligations under the Section 1 (contracts of relevant authorities) of the Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012 (the “Social Value Act”).",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Under the Social Value Act, contracting authorities must consider the economic, environmental and social benefits of their approaches before commencing any procurement process. The Social Value Act applies to the pre-procurement stage of contracts for services and also requires contracting authorities to consider whether they should consult on these issues.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Central government contracting authorities should consider incorporating social value into procurement processes as set out in PPN 06/20 (Taking account of social value in the award of central government contracts) and accompanying guidance.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Consideration must be given to the economic, environmental and social benefits of the contracting authority’s approach to procurement before the process starts.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "consider how the subject-matter of the contract might improve the economic, social and environmental well-being of the ”relevant area”",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "consider whether to consult with relevant groups potentially impacted by the contract e.g. considering citizen and user perspectives when developing social value outcomes and specifications",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "remain mindful that the consideration of social value should inform the procurement approach and the design of the public services required.",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The PPN should be read alongside the relevant parts of the legal framework, including but not limited to, the following provisions of the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 (which may be particularly relevant to the consideration of this PPN):",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Regulation 18: Principles of procurement",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Regulation 56: General principles of awarding contracts",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Regulation 67: Contract award criteria",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Regulation 70: Conditions for performance of contracts",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Additional support and guidance",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Make sure you:",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "read the PPN and any supporting implementation guidance",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "seek legal and commercial advice in the context of specific procurements",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "The Public Services (Social Value) Act 2012",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
